   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Type III",
     "texto": [
      "**Se** + congiuntivo trapassato, and in the other part the condizionale passato: **Se avessi saputo, avrei chiamato** (if I had known, I would have called).",
      "In the «if» part, **fossi stato** (had been) or **avessi fatto** (had done) are used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past conditional",
     "texto": [
      "**avrei** + past participle: **avrei chiamato** (I would have called), **avrei dovuto** (I would have had to), **avrei potuto** (I could have).",
      "With **essere**, it agrees: **sarei andata** (she would have gone)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "If... (trapassato)",
